stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 60 790 Td (Section 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 760 Td 15 TL (Final-year project on GP appointment reminders.) Tj T* (The question was whether sending the reminder 3 hours before an appointment) Tj T* (cut missed appointments compared with sending it 24 hours before.) Tj T* (Two practices in Leeds took part over six weeks in spring 2026.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
