BT /F2 16 Tf 60 790 Td (Section 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 760 Td 15 TL (Missed appointments fell from 7.9% to 6.5% across all patients.) Tj T* (For patients under 30 they fell from 11.2% to 8.4%.) Tj T* (Next time I would run the trial for a full term, to cover the winter months.) Tj T* ET
endstream
